INT. AGING CAVE - ALPINE CHEESE VAULT - NIGHT

Stone walls, sweating. Wheels of cheese stacked to the vaulted ceiling, wooden shelves groaning. Humidity gauge on a post. Temperature: 11 C.

VESNA, 30s, in a hairnet and black coverall, drops from a ventilation shaft onto a shelf. Lands soft. Gloved hands to the stone.

DMITRI, 40s, big for a safecracker, follows. His shoe slips on a wheel. It rolls. He catches it against his chest and holds very still.

VESNA
(whispering)
You are a disaster.

DMITRI
It's slippery.

KOFI (V.O.)
(over earpiece, crackling)
Talk to me. Where are you?

VESNA
(touching her ear)
Inside. Cave three.

KOFI (V.O.)
Camera sweep in forty seconds. Left aisle. Don't breathe.

Vesna waves Dmitri forward. They creep along the wall. At the far end stands a steel cabinet with a keypad. Dmitri sets down the cheese, wipes his hands, and presses his ear to the door as if listening to a heartbeat. Vesna scans the ceiling for the camera, counting on her fingers.

KOFI (V.O.) (CONT'D)
Twenty seconds.

DMITRI
(whispering)
Is nineteen digits.

VESNA
It's always nineteen digits.

KOFI (V.O.)
Ten.

The camera swings toward them. Dmitri throws himself between two stacks of cheese. Vesna dives behind a ladder. The lens sweeps the aisle, pauses, moves on.

Vesna exhales. Dmitri's arm trembles from holding the wheel above him.

DMITRI
Can I put it down?

VESNA
No.

KOFI (V.O.)
Alarm's armed. You have ninety seconds before the guard rotates.

Dmitri finally sets the cheese on the shelf. Cracks his knuckles. Starts the code. The keypad chirps, red, red, green. He glances at Vesna. She glances back. Behind them, soft footsteps echo in the passage. Vesna's eyes go wide.

VESNA
(whispering)
That's not the guard.

KOFI (V.O.)
Say again?

The cabinet clicks open. Inside, a single wheel of cheese, wrapped in gold foil.

DMITRI
That's it?

VESNA
That's forty thousand euros of cheese.

DMITRI
It's a little small.

Footsteps closer. Vesna grabs the wheel. Dmitri grabs her sleeve. They bolt for the shaft.
